  {
    name: "Power User Trap℠",
    href: "/frameworks/power-user-trap/",
    description:
      "The Power User Trap℠: employees operating in continuous doubt, constantly verifying and validating AI outputs without organizational recognition of the cognitive burden. It is one mechanism through which Invisible Attrition℠ occurs.",
